'''Odger''' is an [[NPC]] residing at {{Zone|Odger's Hut}} in the [[Crimson Isle]]. They provide various rewards for obtaining [[Trophy Fish]], in addition to being part of the [[Fishing]] quest for each [[Crimson Isle]] [[Faction]] questline.

